---

Portions of this project (the Tmux sidebar terminal view's layout constants
and behavior — tab list width defaults/min/max, icon-only and compact
breakpoints, right-side default placement, middle-click-to-kill) were derived
from measurements and structure observed in Microsoft's Visual Studio Code
(https://github.com/microsoft/vscode), also MIT licensed:

Copyright (c) 2015 - present Microsoft Corporation

---

The extension icon (media/tmux-logo.png) is the official tmux logo, taken
unmodified from https://github.com/tmux/tmux/tree/master/logo. The view
container icon (media/tmux-icon.svg) is an original monochrome drawing
derived from that logo's design (screen, split panes, status bar), redrawn
because VS Code renders view container icons as a single-color mask. Both are
covered by the logo's ISC license:

Copyright (c) 2015, Jason Long <jason@jasonlong.me>

Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software for any
purpose with or without fee is hereby granted, provided that the above
